[en.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_GRANNY_SMITH]
Granny’s Forgiveness

[en.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_GRANNY_SMITH_desc]
Our firm commitment to the second agricultural reform has affected our diplomatic relations with Appleloosa, and we cannot establish direct contact with “Cousin” Braeburn. However, although Braeburn is now the highest ruler of the Apple family, there is one pony whose opinion he has to respect. We will start persuading her. Of course, we have to show our sincerity and apologize to her wholeheartedly.

[zh.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_GRANNY_SMITH]
婆婆的谅解

[zh.FOCUS_C02_APPLE_GRANNY_SMITH_desc]
我们对第二次农业改革的坚定推行已经影响了我们和苹果鲁萨的外交关系，我们无法与“表哥”布雷本建立直接的联系，但虽然布雷本如今是苹果家族的最高掌权者——但有一位小马的意见他也不得不尊重。我们就从她开始劝说。当然，我们要拿出十足的诚意，全心全意地向她道歉。

